# Indomitable Creativity with X = 3 on Bot1's own Darksteel Citadel (indestructible, so not destroyed) and Bot2's Ornithopter
# and Mox Pearl. Only destroyed permanents count (rulings 2017-02-09): Bot1 reveals nothing and is untouched (no Revealed,
# library unchanged), while Bot2, who controlled both destroyed ones, reveals twice - the second reveal starts from a library
# that no longer holds the first exiled card (Island, Llanowar Elves; then Island, Island, Ornithopter, both an artifact and a
# creature - the revealed list is sorted by name) - and both exiled cards enter together under Bot2's control, then Bot2 shuffles.

[Bot1 Deck]
Darksteel Citadel
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Black Lotus
Indomitable Creativity
Island
Island
Island
Swamp
Forest
Counterspell
Mana Leak
Time Walk
Ancestral Recall
Lightning Bolt
Dark Ritual
Giant Growth
Brainstorm

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Ornithopter
Island x5
Island
Island
Llanowar Elves
Island
Ornithopter
Swamp
Forest
Counterspell
Mana Leak
Time Walk
Ancestral Recall
Lightning Bolt
Dark Ritual
Giant Growth
Brainstorm

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Darksteel Citadel.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Darksteel Citadel.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Indomitable Creativity.Cast(X: 3)
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Darksteel Citadel; Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter; Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Darksteel Citadel.Tapped = true
Bot1.Revealed = (absent)
Bot1.Library.Count = 10
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl = (absent)
Bot2.Battlefield = Llanowar Elves; Ornithopter
Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Tapped = false
Bot2.Graveyard = Mox Pearl; Ornithopter
Bot2.Revealed = Island; Island; Island; Llanowar Elves; Ornithopter
Bot2.Library.Count = 12
Bot1.Library = Swamp; Forest; Counterspell; Mana Leak; Time Walk; Ancestral Recall; Lightning Bolt; Dark Ritual; Giant Growth; Brainstorm
Bot2.Library != Island; Island; Swamp; Forest; Counterspell; Mana Leak; Time Walk; Ancestral Recall; Lightning Bolt; Dark Ritual; Giant Growth; Brainstorm
